## User

Split a list into chunks of the given size; the last chunk may be shorter.

## Type

type
```haskell
chunksOf :: Int -> [a] -> [[a]]
```

## Term

```haskell
chunksOf n xs = take n xs : chunksOf n (drop n xs)
```

